"values": ["Hello and Welcome to the Cabinet of Novelties!
I’m The Collector, the finest connoisseur of magical items across all planes!
MYAHAHAHAHA!
Did you see my commercial?
MYAHAHAHA!
What’d you think of it? D’you love it???
Ahhh who’re we kiddin?
OF COURSE YOU DID, YOU’RE HERE! 
MYAHAHAHAHAHAHA!
*COUGHS*"]
}
