tracks/1/type = "value"
tracks/1/imported = false
tracks/1/enabled = true
tracks/1/path = NodePath("../UI/Control/Dialogue:dialogue_text")
tracks/1/interp = 0
tracks/1/loop_wrap = true
tracks/1/keys = {
"times": PackedFloat32Array(0),
"transitions": PackedFloat32Array(1),
"update": 0,
"values": ["HELLO AND WELCOME![pause] TO THE CABINET OF NOVELTIES!
I’M [pause][collector]THE COLLECTOR[/collector].
THE FINEST CONNOISSEUR OF MAGICAL ITEMS ACROSS ALL PLANES!
MYAHAHAHA!
DID YOU SEE MY COMMERCIAL?
HEHEHEHA
WHAT'D YOU THINK OF IT?[pause] DID YOU LOVE IT???
AHH, WHO ARE WE KIDDIN'!?
OF COURSE YOU DID, YOU'RE HERE!!
MYAHAHAHAHAHAHA!
*COUGHS*
uegh
SINCE I THINK THIS IS YOUR FIRST TIME IN MY [pause]LITTLE SHOP, LET ME GIVE YOU A TOUR AROUND~
WHAT YOU SEE IN FRONT OF YOU IS ME, [pause][collector]THE COLLECTOR[/collector] [pause]AND MY [pause][table]TABLE[/table].
IT'S THE BEST SPOT AROUND THE SHOP!
IF YOU EVER WAND AN EDUCATED OPINION, WANT TO SHOP FOR ITEMS, OR [pause]HAVE ANY QUESTIONS, FEEL FREE TO TALK TO ME HERE!
HMHMHMM~
NOW [pause]IF YOU TURN [pause]TO THE RIGHT, [pause]I-
Why aren’t you moving.
OH! YOU CAN'T LOOK AROUND! HOLD ON, HOLD ON.
HRM!
I’M GIVING YOU THE FULL RIGHT TO POSSESS ONE OF MY HANDS TO PHYSICALLY TURN YOUR HEAD TO LOOK AROUND THE SHOP.
NOW! [pause]WHERE WERE WE?
OH! [pause]RIGHT, [pause]TURNING TO THE RIGHT, [pause]THIS [pause]IS THE CONSOLE STATION, [pause]YOUR LITTLE PLAYPEN WHERE YOU CAN PLAY WITH [pause]MY CARTRIDGES, [pause]CHECK OUT MY MOST DEDICATED COLLECTOREES, [pause]AND [pause]THE SETTINGS MENU TO MAGICALLY MODIFY [pause]YOUR CONSOLE.
NOW, TURNING ALL THE WAY-
HELLO-
-OVER TO THE LEFT IS WHAT WE CALL [pause]THE “CHILL” SECTION OF THE SHOP. [pause]THERE ARE A FEW MISCELLANEOUS ITEMS HERE, BUT I EVEN SET UP [pause]A LITTLE KOLLECTADEX FOR YOU TO CHECK THE VESSELS, [pause]AND CREATURES YOU MEET OR CONVINCE.
THAT'S REALLY IT FOR THIS [pause]BEAUT' OF A SHOP.
I’LL BE MAKING MORE CHANGES IN THE NEAR FUTURE AROUND THE SHOP, SINCE [pause]I SIGNED MY LEASE IN THIS LOCATION A FEW MOMENTS AGO AND STILL HAVE TO UNPACK. 
NOW [pause]FEEL FREE TO LOOK AROUND, [pause]TALK TO MEEEEE, [pause]POKE THINGS, [pause]AND WHENEVER YOU'RE READY, [pause]HEAD OVER TO THE CONSOLE STATION TO START COLLECTING THE ITEMS [pause]I NEED YOU TO.
ALRIGHT, NOW GO! [pause]POKE THINGS! [pause]POKE TVs, [pause]POKE THE CONSOLE, [pause]POKE THE CANDLES, [pause]POKE EVERYTHING!! 
AHAHAHAHAHAA!
*COUGHS*
EXCEPT FOR MY HAT.
DON'T POKE THE HAT. 
HAVE FUNNNN~!"]
}
