tracks/1/keys = {
"times": PackedFloat32Array(0),
"transitions": PackedFloat32Array(1),
"update": 0,
"values": ["THOSE WERE ALL THE LITTLE CARTRIDGES I COULD CONJURE UP FROM THE ESSENCE I HAD LEFT IN THE MEANTIME.
I KNOW YOU HAD SOME FUN DESPITE THE CHALLENGES[pause], SO YOU’RE WELCOME[pause] FOR THE UNFORGETTABLE GAMING EXPERIENCE OF A LIFETIME!
FOR NOW, THOUGH,[pause] I STILL NEED TO LOOK AROUND THE SHOP, UNPACK AND MOVE THINGS AROUND, EXTRACT THE SOUL FROM THE SOULTOKENS, AND THEN!!
WHENEVER I DO MAKE SOMETHING, EXPECT A NEWS ANNOUNCEMENT ON MY WEBSITE
CABINETOFNOVELTIES.COM,[pause] ON MY [pause]“TWITTER” @COLLECTOR1938, [pause]AND ON MY DISCORD COMMUNITY SERVER!!
WHICH YOU CAN ALSO FIND ON MY WEBSITE AND TWITTER.
YOU CAN USE IT TO TALK TO FELLOW COLLECTOREES, POST WORSHIP ART OF ME, [pause]AND SO ON AND SO FORTH.
NOW, [pause]FEEL FREE TO STAY AND OGLE AROUND. I’LL HAVE MORE FOR YOU.
TOMORROW…
TOMORROW... [pause]MY...[pause] TIME.
NO NOT YOURS. 
ENJOY NOW!"]
}
